---
import { POS_EARLY_ACCESS_URL } from '../../lib/appUrls'
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 pb-20">
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-zinc-950 rounded-4xl p-12 sm:p-16 text-center ring-1 ring-white/10 text-white">
    <!-- Ambient Indigo Core Glow -->
    <div class="absolute -top-16 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-36 bg-indigo-600/30 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-200 border border-white/10 mb-4 font-mono">
        <span>🔒</span> PROGRAM PILOT TERBATAS
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold sm:text-5xl">
        Ingin kasir toko Anda bebas macet di jam sibuk?
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-base sm:text-lg font-medium text-zinc-400">
        POS.Hfeit saat ini dibuka dalam program pilot eksklusif untuk merchant terpilih. Ajukan akses awal dan jadilah yang pertama menikmati kecepatan sub-16ms.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a 
          href={POS_EARLY_ACCESS_URL} 
          class="rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-zinc-950 shadow-xl hover:bg-zinc-100 transition inline-block"
        >
          Ajukan Akses Awal via Email &rsaquo;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
